(CRITTER CAPTURE) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
(Game Overview) Tj
T*
T*
/F2 13 Tf
(WHAT IT IS) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
T*
T*
(Critter Capture is a monster-catching role-playing game in the classic Game Boy) Tj
T*
(tradition, rebuilt to a modern standard. You walk a region on foot, meet wild) Tj
T*
(creatures in the tall grass, battle them in turn-based fights, and catch them) Tj
T*
(to build a team. It runs in a web browser, so it plays on a tablet and inside a) Tj
T*
(Meta Quest 3 headset, with nothing to install.) Tj
T*
T*
(The aim is not to out-size the games that inspired it. It is to be distinctive) Tj
T*
(and premium: a tight, dense adventure that feels like a remake rather than a) Tj
T*
(throwback to one.) Tj
T*
T*
/F2 13 Tf
(THE WORLD) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
T*
T*
(The region is Rivenmoor. The journey runs in one long line that keeps opening:) Tj
T*
(a coastal home village, three towns in a wooded valley, a lake crossing, a) Tj
T*
(mining town, a mountain pass, a coastal city, and finally the league tower.) Tj
T*
T*
(Each leg is gated by a badge or a field power, so progress is also permission.) Tj
T*
(You can see where you are not yet allowed to go, which is what makes exploring) Tj
T*
(feel like achievement.) Tj
T*
T*
(Roughly twenty areas: six towns, crossing routes, two forests, two cave) Tj
T*
(systems, a coast and a sea route, a mountain, a marsh, ruins, and the league) Tj
T*
(approach. Time of day shifts the colour of the world and changes what appears) Tj
T*
(in the grass - some creatures come out only at night, others only in rain.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
