(THE CREATURES) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
T*
T*
(Thirty-six species ship in the first chapter. They are built as data rather) Tj
T*
(than code, so the roster can grow past a hundred later by adding entries rather) Tj
T*
(than features, and they sit in two- and three-stage evolution lines.) Tj
T*
T*
(The type chart is our own: twelve types - Ember, Tide, Verdant, Stone, Gale,) Tj
T*
(Spark, Frost, Shade, Radiance, Iron, Wild and Mind. Twelve is enough for a rich) Tj
T*
(set of strengths and weaknesses, and few enough to actually learn.) Tj
T*
T*
(Every creature carries the modern six statistics - health, attack, defence,) Tj
T*
(special attack, special defence and speed - plus hidden individual values, a) Tj
T*
(nature, and training values earned in battle. Two creatures of the same species) Tj
T*
(are never quite the same.) Tj
T*
T*
/F2 13 Tf
(THE BATTLE SYSTEM) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
T*
T*
(Battles are turn-based, one creature out at a time. The depth comes from how) Tj
T*
(many systems interlock:) Tj
T*
T*
(- Moves with power, accuracy, limited uses, priority, a physical or special) Tj
T*
(  split, a type, and often a secondary effect.) Tj
T*
(- Five status conditions of our own - Scorch, Blight, Static, Slumber and) Tj
T*
(  Chill. Each behaves differently, and they do not all stack.) Tj
T*
(- Statistics that can be raised or lowered six steps either way.) Tj
T*
(- Critical hits, damage variance, and type multipliers running from no effect) Tj
T*
(  to four times damage.) Tj
T*
(- Weather that changes damage and interacts with abilities.) Tj
T*
(- Held items, switching, a party of six, and storage beyond that.) Tj
T*
(- Catching with tiered balls, odds that depend on the target's remaining health) Tj
T*
(  and status, and a throw-and-wobble you can watch.) Tj
T*
(- Experience, growth, learning moves on level, and evolution.) Tj
T*
(- Trainers who spot you across a route and battle for prize money.) Tj
T*
(- An opponent that switches out of a bad matchup and heals when low, rather) Tj
T*
(  than picking moves at random.) Tj
ET
endstream
